Jemstones includes item, block and Ruby entity definitions, recipes, models, textures and English names
adapted from KAGIC (https://github.com/kagic/KAGIC).

Upstream attribution from KAGIC's README:
"KAGIC" source code and its derivatives, including bytecode and executables, are licensed under an GNU Public License v3 by "The KAGIC Team" ("akrivus", "HeimrArnadalr", "Judacraz", "Lattie", "obsidian29", "Seartisian", "taaffeite", "Tourmaline-Iris").

The GPL version 3 text is included in LICENSE. The imported code has been adapted to Forge 1.20.1 and the jemstones namespace.
Ruby currently has basic movement, combat and ownership with one fixed original
appearance. The Ruby Gem item summons an owned Ruby. Fusion, jobs and the
full gem lifecycle are not yet ported.
Textures are copied unchanged. Models, resource references and language keys
are adapted; Ruby limb pivots are adjusted for the new model API.
Ruby voice sounds are unavailable in the upstream checkout used for this port.

